  "notes": "Basic school has 9 grades split into a first and second stage (stupeň). Reform under way: the 2023 curriculum, compulsory from grade 1 in 2026/27, makes the first stage grades 1–5 (cycles 1–3 and 4–5) instead of 1–4. Secondary years are numbered afresh; gymnázium lasts 4, 5 or 8 years (prima = grade 6)."
